{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="section faq">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="eyebrow center">{{ s.eyebrow | default: 'Questions' }}</div>
    <h2 class="center">{{ s.heading | default: 'The Questions You’re Probably Asking' }}</h2>
    <div style="margin-top:30px">
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <details {% if forloop.first %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary>{{ block.settings.question }}</summary>
            <p>{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <details open><summary>Will it burn?</summary><p>No. It&rsquo;s a warm, spicy tingle that fades in minutes, not a burn. That warmth is the ginger and capsicum bringing blood flow to your lips, and it&rsquo;s how you know it&rsquo;s working. There&rsquo;s no cinnamon, which is what makes many plumpers sting. If it feels like burning rather than warmth, you applied too much: one thin layer is all it takes.</p></details>
        <details open><summary>Is it safe?</summary><p>It&rsquo;s made without cinnamon or parabens, and one thin layer is all you need. If you have very sensitive lips, start with a small amount. If you&rsquo;re allergic to capsicum, ginger or wintergreen, skip it, and stop using it if irritation doesn&rsquo;t settle.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does it last?</summary><p>The visible plump typically lasts 2&ndash;4 hours per application, and hyaluronic acid keeps lips soft after the tingle fades. Reapply any time. With daily use, most people notice smoother, fuller-looking lips between applications after a few weeks.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will it work on thin lips?</summary><p>Thin lips are exactly who it&rsquo;s made for. The tingle brings blood flow to the surface, so lips look fuller, rosier and more defined in about five minutes. It&rsquo;s a visible, temporary plump, not a change to your lip shape like filler, so build up from one thin layer until you like the look.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will it dry out my lips like other plumpers?</summary><p>No. This is the complaint we built it around. Hyaluronic acid and vitamin E go on in the same swipe as the tingle, so lips end up softer after use, not chapped.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does it actually plump, or is it just gloss?</summary><p>It&rsquo;s the warmth, not the shine, doing the work. You&rsquo;ll see fuller, rosier, more defined lips in about five minutes. It isn&rsquo;t filler, but it&rsquo;s a real, visible plump you can top up any time.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I wear it under or over lipstick?</summary><p>Both. Wear it alone as a glossy tint, as a base before liner and lipstick, or dab it over the top for extra shine and volume.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if I don&rsquo;t love it?</summary><p>Love your lips in 30 days or your money back. Contact us for a full refund &mdash; no need to send it back.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How fast is shipping?</summary><p>Orders are processed in 24&ndash;48 hours and arrive in about 5&ndash;9 business days, with tracking emailed once your order ships. Standard shipping is free in the US; international orders ship for a flat $9.99.</p></details>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Questions" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The Questions You’re Probably Asking" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "name": "Question",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "question", "label": "Question", "default": "Question?" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "answer", "label": "Answer", "default": "Answer." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}
